es", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "009H", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$V \\subset Y$", "MATH_0002": "$s \\in \\mathcal{G}(V)$", "MATH_0003": "$\\varphi_V(s) \\in \\mathcal{F}(f^{-1}V)$", "MATH_0004": "$\\varphi(s)_x$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{F}_x$", "MATH_0006": "$x \\in f^{-1}V$", "MATH_0007": "$U \\in \\mathcal{B}_X$", "MATH_0008": "$x \\in U \\subset f^{-1}V$", "MATH_0009": "$\\varphi(s)_x$", "MATH_0010": "$(U, \\varphi_V^U(s))$", "MATH_0011": "$(\\varphi(s)_x)_{x \\in f^{-1}V}$", "MATH_0012": "$(*)$", "MATH_0013": "$\\varphi_V^U$", "MATH_0014": "$U$", "MATH_0015": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0016": "$(\\varphi(s)_x)_{x \\in f^{-1}V}$", "MATH_0017": "$\\varphi_V(s)$", "MATH_0018": "$\\mathcal{F}(f^{-1}V)$", "MATH_0019": "$\\varphi_V : \\mathcal{G}(V) \\to \\mathcal{F}(f^{-1}V)$", "MATH_0020": "$\\varphi_V$", "MATH_0021": "$\\varphi_V^U$", "MATH_0022": "$\\varphi_V$", "MATH_0023": "$V \\in \\mathcal{B}_Y$", "MATH_0024": "$f$", "MATH_0025": "$$\n\\mathcal{G}_{f(x)} \\longrightarrow \\mathcal{F}_x\n$$", "MATH_0026": "$\\varphi_V^U$", "MATH_0027": "$V \\in \\mathcal{B}_Y$", "MATH_0028": "$f(x)$", "MATH_0029": "$U \\in \\mathcal{B}_X$", "MATH_0030": "$x$", "MATH_0031": "$\\mathcal{G}$", "MATH_0032": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0033": "$f^{-1}\\mathcal{G} \\to \\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0034": "$f^{-1}\\mathcal{G} \\to \\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0035": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0036": "$\\varphi$", "MATH_0037": "$f$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-extend-off-basis}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-condition-star-sections}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-f-map-basis-below-structures}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{lemma-f-map-sets-algebraic-structures}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{proof}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\medskip", "STRUCT_0003": "\\noindent", "STRUCT_0004": "\\medskip", "STRUCT_0005": "\\noindent", "STRUCT_0006": "\\end{proof}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:3a328f3ecdd7bf206c3ba8252431b7eb477778341bc32732d6ca44a9aa6056c4", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:11b9aee5f909188c2c4586ef3f5d2a05f085638b85234c85fd4150c302f0daa5", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\nLet us first proves this for sheaves of sets.\nFix <MATH_0001> open. Pick <MATH_0002>.\nWe are going to construct an element\n<MATH_0003>.\nWe can define a value <MATH_0004> in the stalk <MATH_0005>\nfor every <MATH_0006> by picking a <MATH_0007>\nwith <MATH_0008> and setting <MATH_0009>\nequal to the equivalence class of <MATH_0010>\nin the stalk. Clearly, the family <MATH_0011>\nsatisfies condition <MATH_0012> because the maps <MATH_0013>\nfor varying <MATH_0014>\nare compatible with restrictions in the sheaf <MATH_0015>.\nThus, by the proof of Lemma <REF_0001>\nwe see that <MATH_0016> corresponds\nto a unique element <MATH_0017> of <MATH_0018>.\nThus we have defined a set map\n<MATH_0019>.\nThe compatibility between <MATH_0020> and <MATH_0021>\nfollows from Lemma <REF_0002>.\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\nWe leave it to the reader to show that the construction\nof <MATH_0022> is compatible with restriction mappings as we vary\n<MATH_0023>. Thus we may apply Lemma\n<REF_0003> above to\n``glue'' them to the desired <MATH_0024>-map.\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\nFinally, we note that the map of sheaves of sets so constructed\nsatisfies the property that the map on stalks\n<MATH_0025>\nis the colimit of the system of maps <MATH_0026> as\n<MATH_0027> varies over those elements that\ncontain <MATH_0028> and <MATH_0029> varies over those elements that\ncontain <MATH_0030>. In particular, if <MATH_0031> and <MATH_0032>\nare the underlying sheaves of sets of sheaves of algebraic structures,\nthen we see that the maps on stalks is a morphism of algebraic\nstructures. Hence we conclude that the associated map of\nsheaves of underlying sets <MATH_0033>\nsatisfies the assumptions of\nLemma <REF_0004>.\nWe conclude that <MATH_0034>\nis a morphism of sheaves with values in <MATH_0035>.\nAnd by adjointness this means that <MATH_0036> is\nan <MATH_0037>-map of sheaves of algebraic structures.\n<STRUCT_0006>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:3a67e7b52b896ffb6065a149585d2142fed8421a6fd83bb0c2e5fd7d2a787522", "unit_id": "inventory:sheaves:009X:proof/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "sha256:b6d20a4236da02b5279b4ba28c895be5e819c2955643f09e546b4a08b27c0234", "hash": "sha256:b6d20a4236da02b5279b4ba28c895be5e819c2955643f09e546b4a08b27c0234", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-reference", "location": {"byte_end": 75326, "byte_start": 74690, "file": "sheaves.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:ce890501eac337b11aaa080fa6308548ad9dcf67acba0783ed7129883eba0bc2", "line_end": 2241, "line_start": 2223}, "owner_tag": "008J", "parent_tag": "008C", "requested_label": "sheaves-definition-f-map", "requested_tag": "008J", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "sheaves", "math_text_regions": [{"delimiter_kind": "display-dollar", "pieces": [{"kind": "locked", "placeholder": "MATHSEG_0001"}, {"kind": "text", "slot_id": "math/0001/text/0001"}, {"kind": "locked", "placeholder": "MATHSEG_0002"}, {"kind": "text", "slot_id": "math/0001/text/0002"}, {"kind": "locked", "placeholder": "MATHSEG_0003"}], "region_id": "math/0001", "slots": [{"boundary_placeholders": ["MATHSEG_0001", "MATHSEG_0002"], "classification_witness": {"anchor": {"file": "sheaves.tex", "kind": "section", "matches": [{"command_byte_span": {"end": 75117, "start": 75095}, "command_hash": "sha256:fa59f0f9a0955b0c8695bb7988819b577a7140794383eefbb483495647afdef5", "container_byte_span": {"end": 75326, "start": 74690}, "container_hash": "sha256:ce890501eac337b11aaa080fa6308548ad9dcf67acba0783ed7129883eba0bc2"}, {"command_byte_span": {"end": 75183, "start": 75161}, "command_hash": "sha256:fa59f0f9a0955b0c8695bb7988819b577a7140794383eefbb483495647afdef5", "container_byte_span": {"end": 75326, "start": 74690}, "container_hash": "sha256:ce890501eac337b11aaa080fa630